 là rẻ lắm rồi đấy.","ipa":["θɹi","ˈθaʊzənd","sɪks","ˈhʌndɹəd","ðæts","ɔlˈɹɛdi","ə","ˈvɛɹi","ɡʊd","pɹaɪs"],"start":40.044,"end":43.934,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,40.044],[1,40.245],[2,40.713],[3,40.99],[4,42.25],[5,42.514],[6,42.923],[7,43.007],[8,43.32],[9,43.512]]},{"speaker":"tomas","en":"I understand, but I need to pay for the repairs, too.","vi":"Tôi hiểu, nhưng tôi còn phải trả tiền sửa chữa nữa.","ipa":["aɪ","ˌʌndɚˈstænd","bʌt","aɪ","nid","tu","peɪ","fɔɹ","ðə","ɹɪˈpɛɹz","tu"],"start":44.724,"end":47.994,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,44.724],[1,44.833],[2,45.745],[3,45.888],[4,45.94],[5,46.201],[6,46.305],[7,46.578],[8,46.735],[9,46.826],[10,47.607]]},{"speaker":"crane","en":"Lots of people want this car, you know.","vi":"Nhiều người muốn chiếc xe này lắm, cậu biết đấy.","ipa":["lɑts","ʌv","ˈpipəl","wɑnt","ðɪs","kɑɹ","ju","noʊ"],"start":48.784,"end":50.764,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,48.784],[1,49.059],[2,49.179],[3,49.527],[4,49.756],[5,49.936],[6,50.429],[7,50.513]]},{"speaker":"tomas","en":"Then maybe you should sell it to them. Three thousand is a fair price.","vi":"Vậy có lẽ ông nên bán cho họ. Ba nghìn là giá hợp lý.","ipa":["ðɛn","ˈmeɪbi","ju","ʃʊd","sɛl","ɪt","tu","ðɛm","θɹi","ˈθaʊzənd","ɪz","ə","fɛɹ","pɹaɪs"],"start":51.554,"end":56.174,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,51.554],[1,51.763],[2,52.062],[3,52.166],[4,52.414],[5,52.687],[6,52.791],[7,52.921],[8,54.16],[9,54.46],[10,55.046],[11,55.176],[12,55.267],[13,55.58]]},{"speaker":"crane","en":"Wait, wait. How about we meet in the middle? Three thousand four hundred.","vi":"Khoan, khoan. Hay mình gặp nhau ở giữa nhé? Ba nghìn bốn trăm.","ipa":["weɪt","weɪt","haʊ","əˈbaʊt","wi","mit","ɪn","ðə","ˈmɪdəl","θɹi","ˈθaʊzənd","fɔɹ","ˈhʌndɹəd"],"start":56.964,"end":62.534,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,56.964],[1,57.427],[2,58.675],[3,58.939],[4,59.24],[5,59.396],[6,59.661],[7,59.757],[8,59.865],[9,61.103],[10,61.403],[11,61.872],[12,62.137]]},{"speaker":"tomas","en":"Three thousand 